{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/o01-approval-rate.md -Raw; Write-Output \"=====ACCEPT=====\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/o01-acceptance.json -Raw'","aggregated_output":"# O01：审批分类率诊断\n\n仅实现诊断日志，不实现审批自动化或新看板。计数是write/edit/apply_patch破坏性分类中requiresApproval的比例，不是UI对话框/真人决定次数。\n\n## 启用与范围\n\n现有配置diagnostics.enabled必须显式为true，且进程诊断开关开启。省略或false不收集新窗口、不写新告警；累计计数和工具行为不变。范围为单运行时进程，不是per-run或Main进程副本。沿用现有日志级别、文件和log.record通道。\n\n## 预登记窗口\n\n- 仅保存最后100个已监测分类及时间；每20个新分类评估一次，至少20样本。\n- 连续两窗比例≥0.5告警；告警后连续两窗≤0.3清除。中间区间重置连续计数，不自动清除已有告警。\n- TTL为300000ms。零/不足/过期、时钟无效/回退为unavailable，rate=null，不能当正常。\n- 重复读取不改变连续窗；没有后台定时器。过期在下一次观察/读取处理，日志的expiresAt不是实时轮询承诺。\n- 参数是显式诊断试用preset，不是安全阈值，不新增配置键或修改生产冻结默认。\n\n## 消费者与故障\n\n真实路径：工具工厂的显式选择→原分类包装器→原累计计数与有界窗口→diagnosticLogger→现有日志/log.record。记录样本、窗口、原因、建议，不记录工具参数。消费者异常不改变工具结果，下一次观察可重试。关闭后清掉诊断窗口，不回填/重放旧分类。\n\n验收以o01-acceptance.json及O01-SHA256SUMS为准；未生成前不声称已通过。B00历史摘要保持原样。UI、真实模型、六pilot和发布不属于本包。\n\n逐个TTL淘汰但仍有足够新鲜样本时，继续每20个新有效分类评估，不能不断重置步长而使告警/清除饿死。实际不足样本会重置确认序列，不能用未测窗口预先确认。未选择监测的分类结束当前窗口，避免跨未覆盖时段拼接统计。\n\nTTL边界的精确补样允许连续确认；任何正持续时间的不足样本区间，即使到达样本把数量恢复到20，也使旧确认失效。按到达前的TTL覆盖推断，不新增后台定时器。\n\r\n=====ACCEPT=====\r\n{\n  \"schemaVersion\": 1,\n  \"asOf\": \"2026-10-09\",\n  \"timezone\": \"Asia/Shanghai\",\n  \"actor\": \"codex-o01-mainline-developer\",\n  \"driven_by\": \"agent\",\n  \"scope\": {\n    \"task\": \"TF-0272\",\n    \"packet\": \"O01\",\n    \"title\": \"审批分类率的受控诊断告警与清除\",\n    \"source\": \"synthetic-local-file-tool\",\n    \"liveProvider\": false,\n    \"realHuman\": false\n  },\n  \"decision\": {\n    \"status\": \"PASS\",\n    \"evidenceTier\": \"clean-candidate-local-automated-acceptance\",\n    \"reason\": \"Complete required fast/comms, 79 focused/runtime-required tests, independent disk replay and guarded source review passed; no product-lock graduation.\"\n  },\n  \"candidate\": {\n    \"commit\": \"987945f322ede098eb4995decb6d202b1af5146d\",\n    \"tree\": \"8364baf69d2bad99fb439d4102dc057af5172cce\",\n    \"dirty\": false,\n    \"branch\": \"codex/harness-gap-o01-resume-20261009\",\n    \"base\": \"47031406a05eb946d2066363060e672f62b418e2\",\n    \"workspace\": \"C:/Users/27933/.codex/worktrees/harness-gap-o01-resume-20261009/ClawX\",\n    \"startedAt\": \"2026-10-09T07:21:40.707Z\",\n    \"finishedAt\": \"2026-10-09T07:40:07.635Z\"\n  },\n  \"behavior\": {\n    \"enabledOnlyWhen\": \"config.diagnostics.enabled === true AND existing process diagnostic switch\",\n    \"scope\": \"runtime-process\",\n    \"measurement\": \"destructive-tier-classification; not UI prompts/human approvals\",\n    \"preset\": {\n      \"maxSamples\": 100,\n      \"minimumSamples\": 20,\n      \"stride\": 20,\n      \"high\": 0.5,\n      \"low\": 0.3,\n      \"windows\": 2,\n      \"ttlMs\": 300000\n    },\n    \"consumer\": \"existing diagnosticLogger -> log.record/file\",\n    \"missing\": \"null rate, unavailable; no healthy zero from absent data\",\n    \"effectPolicyUnchanged\": true,\n    \"rollback\": \"Disable existing diagnostics / omit explicit selection; window cleared and old cumulative counts preserved\"\n  },\n  \"repairs\": [\n    {\n      \"issue\": \"Per-sample TTL eviction starved stride and alert/clear confirmation in prior implementation\",\n      \"proof\": \"prior session regression kept in tests; 10s/15s cadence and 5s clear pass\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"issue\": \"Late arrival masked a positive-duration coverage gap and reused stale high/low confirmation\",\n      \"before\": {\n        \"tests\": 28,\n        \"passed\": 25,\n        \"failed\": 3,\n        \"skipped\": 0,\n        \"receipt\": \"red-concealed-coverage-gap.receipt.json\"\n      },\n      \"after\": {\n        \"o01Tests\": 28,\n        \"passed\": 28,\n        \"failed\": 0,\n        \"skipped\": 0\n      },\n      \"fix\": \"Check expiry of the 20th ne