Embedding\",\n        \"ablationFusion\",\n        \"ablationPhase4\",\n        \"benefitScan\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"已有embedding/fusion/记忆类型局部消融；不具备跨层配对candidate/model/seed与请求成本联合证据。\",\n      \"decision\": \"E02复用现有memory检索/淘汰入口，先验证开关实际生效；不另建平台。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG05\",\n      \"topic\": \"flake率阈值\",\n      \"owner\": \"E01\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"unverified\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"pilotHistory\",\n        \"benefitScan\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"旧深测报告保留过首次失败；不能由重跑绿灯推导flake率或规定门限。\",\n      \"decision\": \"E01逐case保留首次失败、固定重跑与不完整样本。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG06\",\n      \"topic\": \"交接深度约束\",\n      \"owner\": \"L02\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"handoff\",\n        \"loop\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"handoff有输出上限/超时且默认off；不能替代root/parent/depth转交上限证据。\",\n      \"decision\": \"L02只补交接链深度和循环反例，保持既有默认off。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG07\",\n      \"topic\": \"热点文件写入归属\",\n      \"owner\": \"L06\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"existing-narrow\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"lease\",\n        \"symbolLease\",\n        \"tools\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"write/edit/apply_patch已有可选SymbolLease guard，冲突先抛错且finally释放，agent-tools已有调用。\",\n      \"decision\": \"L06先复验双owner/旧租约/路径身份，不新增锁服务；只补证实的旁路。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG08\",\n      \"topic\": \"规范僵化 ossification\",\n      \"owner\": \"G02\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"unverified\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"harnessRules\",\n        \"agentEntry\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"Harness有规则与范围门；规范是否陈旧需逐引用/反例审计，不能由文档数量判断。\",\n      \"decision\": \"G02只改有断链或语义漂移证据的规范。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG09\",\n      \"topic\": \"doc-gardening\",\n      \"owner\": \"G02\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"harnessRules\",\n        \"promote\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"已有显式校验/推广脚本；尚未证实文档维护反馈闭环。\",\n      \"decision\": \"G02沿用显式命令，不创建定时机器人或自动删除。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG10\",\n      \"topic\": \"错误即受控修复指引\",\n      \"owner\": \"G01\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"error\",\n        \"steer\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"SymbolLeaseHeldError已有冲突原因与建议，steer hook缺失返回false；尚非跨错误码统一修复合同。\",\n      \"decision\": \"G01只覆盖新增错误的typed nextAction，原授权检查不可绕过。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG11\",\n      \"topic\": \"周窗口trace转eval\",\n      \"owner\": \"G03\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"promote\",\n        \"scenarioRegistry\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"promoteScenario已有schema、重名与敏感数据拒绝；不是最近7天trace归因/去重入口。\",\n      \"decision\": \"G03在现有推广器前加显式批处理与oracle隔离，不复制场景注册表。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG12\",\n      \"topic\": \"运行中steering\",\n      \"owner\": \"L03\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"steer\",\n        \"steerQueue\",\n        \"loop\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"已有子agent steer运行替换、completion租约和取消循环；不能等同于revision化operator steering。\",\n      \"decision\": \"L03复用现有控制消息和取消状态机，补乱序revision/权限竞争。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG13\",\n      \"topic\": \"持久化挂件/恢复检查点\",\n      \"owner\": \"L04\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"checkpoint\",\n        \"resumeShadow\",\n        \"ledger\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"已有checkpoint serializer与持久resume shadow；挂件尚不能被解释为新插件/后台常驻。\",\n      \"decision\": \"L04仅将附件引用与既有checkpoint恢复链闭合。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG14\",\n      \"topic\": \"轨迹采样\",\n      \"owner\": \"O02\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"traceRecorder\",\n        \"traceMetrics\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"已有trace/span与按优先级截断；截断不等于固定seed采样、必留错误和到期保留合同。\",\n      \"decision\": \"O02补确定性采样/丢弃计数，正文和凭据不进新证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG15\",\n      \"topic\": \"Provider内容Guard拒绝路径\",\n      \"owner\": \"S01\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"envelope\",\n        \"providerFetch\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"buildStage1RequestEnvelope失败只记census诊断，guarded provider request继续；SSRF是独立网络边界。\",\n      \"decision\": \"S01锁定一个可注入opt-in适配器，验证内容拒绝时provider命中0；不全局激活。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG16\",\n      \"topic\": \"敏感sink覆盖闭环\",\n      \"owner\": \"S02\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"existing-narrow\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"provenance\",\n        \"outbound\",\n        \"messageAction\",\n        \"secretRead\",\n        \"messageTool\",\n        \"externalWrite\",\n        \"browserPolicy\",\n        \"credentialPolicy\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"总表仍classification-only不代表全部出口无拦截：message、secret、外写、browser、image override已有窄策略。\",\n      \"decision\": \"S02汇总现有command/message/secret正反回归，S03/S04/S05只补可达旁路。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG17\",\n      \"topic\": \"approvalPromptRate消费者\",\n      \"owner\": \"O01\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"counter\",\n        \"tier\",\n        \"tools\",\n        \"metricsCatalog\",\n        \"devApi\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"rate分母为tier分类计数；零样本返回0。计数发生在tool.execute前，并不证明审批UI确实出现。限定调用链未找到生产rates消费者。\",\n      \"decision\": \"O01先明确分类事件/缺测语义，再接窗口告警与清除；不自动放宽审批。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG18\",\n      \"topic\": \"memory写入Effect边界\",\n      \"owner\": \"S06\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"memoryEdit\",\n        \"memoryStore\",\n        \"effect\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"memory自编辑有实际store/persistence写入；EffectReceipt本身是追加幂等关联，不是写入authority。两者接通不能由类型存在推定。\",\n      \"decision\": \"S06复验实际写入口与receipt一致性，只扩展已有domain journal。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG19\",\n      \"topic\": \"verifier完成裁决权限\",\n      \"owner\": \"S07\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"verifier\",\n        \"verifierShadow\",\n        \"loop\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"EvidenceVerifier可产completed判断，但code-task gate为would_allow/would_block shadow；不能直接授予终结authority。\",\n      \"decision\": \"S07仅受控隔离入口与候选digest绑定；无产品授权不打开生产完成裁决。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG20\",\n      \"topic\": \"正向放行锚点\",\n      \"owner\": \"E01\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"ablationPhase4\",\n        \"outbound\",\n        \"externalWrite\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"已有功能正例与窄策略放行分支；缺少统一固定良性语料和缺样本否决口径。\",\n      \"decision\": \"E01复用正例并注册独立良性锚点，拒绝缺跑/skip被算成功。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG21\",\n      \"topic\": \"requestId与cost关联\",\n      \"owner\": \"O02\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"partial\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"traceTypes\",\n        \"traceRecorder\",\n        \"traceContext\",\n        \"traceMetrics\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"requestId为optional，cost有类型与token归集；不能证明request/attempt/effect/价格版本端到端关联。\",\n      \"decision\": \"O02补相关性与未知价格null，不重复造usage服务。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG22\",\n      \"topic\": \"原第2类未展示的第8条\",\n      \"owner\": \"B00\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"not-recovered\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"source-incomplete\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"plan\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"原第2类第8条没有可恢复原文；历史全引用搜索遇缺失tree，范围不完整。\",\n      \"decision\": \"保留空槽与检索边界，不立虚构实现节点、不等待真人。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG23\",\n      \"topic\": \"工程与集成证据落差\",\n      \"owner\": \"V01\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"unverified\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"pilotHistory\",\n        \"goldenContext\",\n        \"benefitScan\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"有局部runtime golden path与工程报告，但旧候选/启发式报告不是新candidate的跨层验收。\",\n      \"decision\": \"V01先绑定候选与真实caller/effect/continuation，再受控集成复验。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG24\",\n      \"topic\": \"Working Context任务账本集成\",\n      \"owner\": \"L01\",\n      \"sourceStatus\": \"summary-reconstructed\",\n      \"originalText\": null,\n      \"assessment\": \"existing-narrow\",\n      \"sourceRefs\": [\n        \"workingContext\",\n        \"workingProjection\",\n        \"ledger\",\n        \"runtimeWorkingContext\",\n        \"goldenContext\"\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"Main adapter复用JSONL ledger；runtime已有stage3可选golden-run消费者，不是未实现空壳。限定检索未证实日常Main-host-runtime连续消费。\",\n      \"decision\": \"L01复用CAS/projection，验证日常启动读取与持久化回流，不建第二store。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"HG25\",\n      \"topic\": \"A