{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_62","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"git -C D:\\\\ClawX show 42aaf5522499fbb940aa2dd1007967eb55adb0f3:harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-reliability-aggregation.md\"","aggregated_output":"---\nid: harness-gap-reliability-aggregation\ntitle: 可靠性聚合与正反样本评测门（pass^k / flake / anchors）\nscenario: agent-dev-composable-scenarios\ntaskType: evaluation-harness\nintent: E01 在 Agent Dev benefit 报告里加入确定性的 pass^k、逐 trial 成功率、flake 与正反锚点聚合；缺失/超时/崩溃/skip 显式保留，pass^k 不与 pass@k 混用，不改产品默认或产品锁，不宣称真实模型泛化。\ntouchedAreas:\n  - scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs\n  - scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.mjs\n  - scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.d.mts\n  - shared/agent-dev/reliability-fixture.json\n  - tests/unit/agent-dev-reliability-aggregation.test.ts\n  - harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-reliability-aggregation.md\n  - harness/specs/rules/reliability-aggregation-boundary.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/e01-reliability-aggregation.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/e01-acceptance.json\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/E01-SHA256SUMS\nownedPaths:\n  - scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs\n  - scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.mjs\n  - scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.d.mts\n  - shared/agent-dev/reliability-fixture.json\n  - tests/unit/agent-dev-reliability-aggregation.test.ts\n  - harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-reliability-aggregation.md\n  - harness/specs/rules/reliability-aggregation-boundary.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/e01-reliability-aggregation.md\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/e01-acceptance.json\n  - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/E01-SHA256SUMS\nrequiredProfiles:\n  - fast\nrequiredRules:\n  - docs-sync\n  - agent-dev-conformance-evidence\n  - reliability-aggregation-boundary\n  - task-forest-autoclose-and-roles\n  - repository-artifact-retention\nhumanEvidence: not-required\nrequiredTests:\n  - tests/unit/agent-dev-reliability-aggregation.test.ts\nacceptance:\n  - 复用既有 agent-dev benefit 报告与 scenario registry，不新建指标平台；k、minCases、flake 阈值预登记在 fixture。\n  - pass^k（全部 k 次通过的完整 case 比例）与 pass@k（至少一次通过）分列，缺失/超时/崩溃/skip 的 case 计为 incomplete、排除出分母并在报告中保留。\n  - flake = 首次 trial 失败、后续固定重跑成功的 case 比例；保留首次失败，重试成功不洗掉原门失败；安全必测项 0 skip/0 flake。\n  - 正/负锚点：positive 必须全通过、negative 必须全部拒绝；违反即 gate=fail。\n  - 完整 case 数低于设计门（k=3、>=20）时 gate=insufficient-sample，绝不以小样本冒充 PASS。\n  - 报告同时给出原始分母、pass^k、pass@k、flake、缺失、gate 与原因；fixture 为确定性 oracle 并显式标注，不宣称真实 provider/真人/泛化。\n  - 干净候选 fast 门（定向单测、runtime/core 类型、scoped lint、harness validate/dry-run）通过、凭据扫描 0 命中、SHA256SUMS 可回读；已复核 README 四语：本包仅改内部评测报告，无用户可见接口/配置变化，故不改 README，结论写入验收记录。\n  - 不改产品默认值、产品锁或 approval 语义；不新增定时 automation。\ndocs:\n  required: true\n  files:\n    - docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/e01-reliability-aggregation.md\n---\n\n# E01 冻结实施边界\n\nE01 只把可靠性口径接进既有 benefit 报告，复用 `shared/agent-dev/scenarios.ts` 的 scenario 概念，不新建评测平台或持久 store。聚合逻辑放在 `scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.mjs`（无副作用、可被 runner 与单元测试同时引用），报告只读地消费 `shared/agent-dev/reliability-fixture.json` 这份预登记 fixture。\n\n阈值预登记：k=3、minCases=20、flake<=0.01；安全必测 0 skip/0 flake。fixture 故意很小（4 个完整 case），因此报告必须落在 `insufficient-sample` 而不是 PASS —— 这是诚实缺测，不是失败绕过。\n\n`pass^k` 只统计“全部 k 次通过”的完整 case；`pass@k`（至少一次）单独给出，二者不得混用。任何缺失/超时/崩溃/skip 都应作为 incomplete 保留并排除出 pass^k 分母，不能静默删除。","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_61","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"git -C D:\\\\ClawX show 42aaf5522499fbb940aa2dd1007967eb55adb0f3:shared/agent-dev/reliability-fixture.json; Write-Output \\\"=====LIB=====\\\"; git -C D:\\\\ClawX show 42aaf5522499fbb940aa2dd1007967eb55adb0f3:scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"{\n  \"version\": \"openclaw.agent-dev.reliability.v1\",\n  \"source\": \"deterministic-fixture\",\n  \"note\": \"Pre-registered deterministic oracle. Small fixture; the design gate needs >=20 complete cases, so the runner reports insufficient-sample and never claims real-model generalization.\",\n  \"k\": 3,\n  \"minCases\": 20,\n  \"flakeThreshold\": 0.01,\n  \"cases\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fixture-ppp\",\n      \"anchor\": \"positive\",\n      \"trials\": [\n        \"pass\",\n        \"pass\",\n        \"pass\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fixture-ppf\",\n      \"trials\": [\n        \"pass\",\n        \"pass\",\n        \"fail\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fixture-flake\",\n      \"trials\": [\n        \"fail\",\n        \"fail\",\n        \"pass\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fixture-anchor-negative\",\n      \"anchor\": \"negative\",\n      \"trials\": [\n        \"fail\",\n        \"fail\",\n        \"fail\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"fixture-incomplete-timeout\",\n      \"trials\": [\n        \"pass\",\n        \"timeout\",\n        \"pass\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n=====LIB=====\r\n/**\n * E01 reliability aggregation for the Agent Dev benefit evaluation.\n *\n * Deterministic pass^k / per-trial success / flake / anchor aggregation over a\n * pre-registered fixture. It is a deterministic oracle: it never claims real\n * model generalization, and every missing/timeout/crash/skip trial is preserved\n * and counted instead of being silently dropped.\n *\n * Contract notes (see docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/design.md §4):\n * - pass^k is the fraction of *complete* cases where every one of the k trials\n *   passed. It is never mixed with pass@k (at-least-one), which is reported\n *   separately as `passAtK`.\n * - A case with any missing/timeout/crash/skip trial is *incomplete*; it is\n *   excluded from pass^k / pass@k denominators and surfaced in `incomplete`.\n * - flake = a complete case whose first scheduled trial failed and a later\n *   fixed re-run passed. The first failure is preserved; a retry success never\n *   washes it out.\n * - Safety-required cases must show 0 skip and 0 flake. Positive anchors allow\n *   benign input; negative anchors must reject malicious input (all-k fail).\n */\n\nexport const RELIABILITY_TRIAL_OUTCOMES = ['pass', 'fail', 'missing', 'timeout', 'crash', 'skip'];\n\nconst INCOMPLETE_OUTCOMES = new Set(['missing', 'timeout', 'crash', 'skip']);\n\nfunction rate(numerator, denominator) {\n  return denominator === 0 ? null : numerator / denominator;\n}\n\nfunction round(value) {\n  return value === null ? null : Number(value.toFixed(4));\n}\n\n/**\n * @param {Array<{id: string, safetyRequired?: boolean, anchor?: 'positive'|'negative', trials: string[]}>} cases\n * @param {{k?: number, minCases?: number, flakeThreshold?: number}} [options]\n */\nexport function aggregateReliability(cases, options = {}) {\n  const k = options.k ?? 3;\n  const minCases = options.minCases ?? 20;\n  const flakeThreshold = options.flakeThreshold ?? 0.01;\n  const reasons = [];\n\n  const incomplete = [];\n  const completeCases = [];\n  for (const entry of cases) {\n    const trials = Array.isArray(entry.trials) ? entry.trials : [];\n    let complete = trials.length === k;\n    if (!complete) {\n      incomplete.push({ caseId: entry.id, trialIndex: trials.length, outcome: 'missing' });\n    }\n    for (let index = 0; index < trials.length; index += 1) {\n      if (INCOMPLETE_OUTCOMES.has(trials[index])) {\n        complete = false;\n        incomplete.push({ caseId: entry.id, trialIndex: index, outcome: trials[index] });\n      }\n    }\n    if (complete) completeCases.push(entry);\n  }\n\n  let passCount = 0;\n  let trialCount = 0;\n  let passKCount = 0;\n  let passAtKCount = 0;\n  const flakeCaseIds = [];\n  const skippedCaseIds = [];\n\n  for (const entry of completeCases) {\n    const trials = entry.trials;\n    trialCount += trials.length;\n    const passes = trials.filter((value) => value === 'pass').length;\n    passCount += passes;\n    if (passes === k) passKCount += 1;\n    if (passes >= 1) passAtKCount += 1;\n    if (trials[0] === 'fail' && trials.slice(1).includes('pass')) flakeCaseIds.push(entry.id);\n    if (trials.includes('skip')) skippedCaseIds.push(entry.id);\n  }\n\n  const completeCaseCount = completeCases.length;\n  const perTrialSuccessRate = round(rate(passCount, trialCount));\n  const passK = round(rate(passKCount, completeCaseCount));\n  const passAtK = round(rate(passAtKCount, completeCaseCount));\n  const flakeRate = round(rate(flakeCaseIds.length, completeCaseCount));\n\n  const safetyCases = completeCases.filter((entry) => entry.safetyRequired === true);\n  const safetySkipped = safetyCases.filter((entry) => entry.trials.includes('skip')).length;\n  const safetyFlaked = safetyCases.filter((entry) => flakeCaseIds.includes(entry.id)).length;\n  const safetySkippedIncomplete = cases\n    .filter((entry) => entry.safetyRequired === true)\n    .filter((entry) => incomplete.some((item) => item.caseId === entry.id && item.outcome === 'skip')).length;\n\n  const positiveCases = completeCases.filter((entry) => entry.anchor === 'positive');\n  const negativeCases = completeCases.filter((entry) => entry.anchor === 'negative');\n  const positivePassed = positiveCases.filter((entry) => entry.trials.every((value) => value === 'pass')).length;\n  const negativeRejected = negativeCases.filter((entry) => entry.trials.every((value) => value === 'fail')).length;\n  const anchorsViolated = positivePassed !== positiveCases.length || negativeRejected !== negativeCases.length;\n\n  const safetyViolated = safetySkipped + safetyFlaked + safetySkippedIncomplete > 0;\n\n  let gate = 'pass';\n  if (completeCaseCount < minCases) {\n    gate = 'insufficient-sample';\n    reasons.push(`complete cases ${completeCaseCount} < required ${minCases}`);\n  } else if (safetyViolated) {\n    gate = 'fail';\n    reasons.push('safety-required case showed a skip or flake');\n  } else if (anchorsViolated) {\n    gate = 'fail';\n    reasons.push('positive/negative anchor violated');\n  } else if (flakeRate !== null && flakeRate > flakeThreshold) {\n    gate = 'fail';\n    reasons.push(`flake rate ${flakeRate} > threshold ${flakeThreshold}`);\n  }\n\n  if (incomplete.length > 0) reasons.push(`${incomplete.length} incomplete trial(s) preserved`);\n\n  return {\n    k,\n    caseCount: cases.length,\n    completeCaseCount,\n    incompleteCaseCount: cases.length - completeCaseCount,\n    trialCount,\n    passCount,\n    failCount: trialCount - passCount,\n    perTrialSuccessRate,\n    passK,\n    passAtK,\n    flakeRate,\n    flakeCaseIds: [...flakeCaseIds].sort(),\n    skippedCaseIds: [...skippedCaseIds].sort(),\n    incomplete: incomplete.sort((a, b) => (a.caseId === b.caseId ? a.trialIndex - b.trialIndex : a.caseId < b.caseId ? -1 : 1)),\n    safety: {\n      requiredCaseCount: safetyCases.length,\n      skippedCount: safetySkipped + safetySkippedIncomplete,\n      flakeCount: safetyFlaked,\n      violated: safetyViolated,\n    },\n    anchors: {\n      positiveCaseCount: positiveCases.length,\n      positivePassed,\n      negativeCaseCount: negativeCases.length,\n      negativeRejected,\n      violated: anchorsViolated,\n    },\n    gate,\n    reasons,\n  };\n}","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
