{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_64","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"git -C D:\\\\ClawX show 42aaf5522499fbb940aa2dd1007967eb55adb0f3:scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.d.mts; Write-Output \\\"=====BENEFIT DIFF=====\\\"; git -C D:\\\\ClawX show 42aaf5522499fbb940aa2dd1007967eb55adb0f3 -- scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"export type ReliabilityTrialOutcome = 'pass' | 'fail' | 'missing' | 'timeout' | 'crash' | 'skip';\n\nexport type ReliabilityCase = {\n  id: string;\n  safetyRequired?: boolean;\n  anchor?: 'positive' | 'negative';\n  trials: ReliabilityTrialOutcome[];\n};\n\nexport type ReliabilityOptions = {\n  k?: number;\n  minCases?: number;\n  flakeThreshold?: number;\n};\n\nexport type ReliabilityIncompleteEntry = {\n  caseId: string;\n  trialIndex: number;\n  outcome: ReliabilityTrialOutcome;\n};\n\nexport type ReliabilityAggregation = {\n  k: number;\n  caseCount: number;\n  completeCaseCount: number;\n  incompleteCaseCount: number;\n  trialCount: number;\n  passCount: number;\n  failCount: number;\n  perTrialSuccessRate: number | null;\n  passK: number | null;\n  passAtK: number | null;\n  flakeRate: number | null;\n  flakeCaseIds: string[];\n  skippedCaseIds: string[];\n  incomplete: ReliabilityIncompleteEntry[];\n  safety: { requiredCaseCount: number; skippedCount: number; flakeCount: number; violated: boolean };\n  anchors: { positiveCaseCount: number; positivePassed: number; negativeCaseCount: number; negativeRejected: number; violated: boolean };\n  gate: 'pass' | 'fail' | 'insufficient-sample';\n  reasons: string[];\n};\n\nexport const RELIABILITY_TRIAL_OUTCOMES: ReliabilityTrialOutcome[];\n\nexport function aggregateReliability(cases: ReliabilityCase[], options?: ReliabilityOptions): ReliabilityAggregation;=====BENEFIT DIFF=====\r\ncommit 42aaf5522499fbb940aa2dd1007967eb55adb0f3\nAuthor: OpenClaw UFTK Pilot <uftk-pilot@openclaw.invalid>\nDate:   Tue Oct 13 19:36:13 2026 +0800\n\n    feat(agent-dev): E01 reliability aggregation (pass^k / flake / anchors) in benefit report\n\ndiff --git a/scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs b/scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs\nindex 898025f03..a177d65f1 100644\n--- a/scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs\n+++ b/scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs\n@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@ import { existsSync } from 'node:fs';\n import { mkdir, readFile, readdir, writeFile } from 'node:fs/promises';\n import { join, resolve } from 'node:path';\n import { performance } from 'node:perf_hooks';\n+import { aggregateReliability } from './lib/reliability-aggregation.mjs';\n \n const ROOT = process.cwd();\n const OUT_DIR = resolve(ROOT, 'artifacts/agent-dev-benefit-eval');\n@@ -92,6 +93,22 @@ Generated: ${report.generatedAt}\n | --- | --- | --- |\n ${tools}\n \n+## Reliability (E01)\n+\n+| Metric | Value |\n+| --- | ---: |\n+| Fixture | ${report.reliability.version} (${report.reliability.source}) |\n+| k | ${report.reliability.k} |\n+| Complete cases | ${report.reliability.completeCaseCount} / ${report.reliability.caseCount} |\n+| pass^k | ${report.reliability.passK} |\n+| pass@k (not mixed with pass^k) | ${report.reliability.passAtK} |\n+| Per-trial success | ${report.reliability.perTrialSuccessRate} |\n+| Flake rate | ${report.reliability.flakeRate} |\n+| Incomplete trials preserved | ${report.reliability.incomplete.length} |\n+| Gate | ${report.reliability.gate} |\n+\n+The reliability block is a deterministic oracle over a pre-registered fixture, not a real-model generalization claim. Missing/timeout/crash/skip trials are preserved and excluded from the pass^k denominator; the small fixture reports insufficient-sample until the design gate (k=3, >=20 complete cases) is met.\n+\n ## Interpretation\n \n - The current in-repo implementation already gives agents ${report.agentDev.scenarioCount} deterministic page entry points and ${report.agentDev.e2eHelperCount} E2E helpers without depending on new packages.\n@@ -108,12 +125,14 @@ const [\n   e2eFixture,\n   schemaText,\n   a11yText,\n+  reliabilityFixtureText,\n ] = await Promise.all([\n   read('shared/agent-dev/scenarios.ts'),\n   read('src/lib/host-api.ts'),\n   read('tests/e2e/fixtures/electron.ts'),\n   read('shared/host-api/agent-dev-schemas.ts'),\n   read('tests/e2e/fixtures/a11y.ts'),\n+  read('shared/agent-dev/reliability-fixture.json'),\n ]);\n \n const scenarioIds = extractScenarioIds(scenarioRegistry);\n@@ -144,6 +163,16 @@ const report = {\n     { package: 'ajv', installed: packageInstalled('ajv'), role: 'JSON schema validation engine' },\n   ],\n };\n+const reliabilityFixture = JSON.parse(reliabilityFixtureText);\n+report.reliability = {\n+  version: reliabilityFixture.version,\n+  source: reliabilityFixture.source,\n+  ...aggregateReliability(reliabilityFixture.cases, {\n+    k: reliabilityFixture.k,\n+    minCases: reliabilityFixture.minCases,\n+    flakeThreshold: reliabilityFixture.flakeThreshold,\n+  }),\n+};\n report.durationMs = Number((performance.now() - start).toFixed(1));\n \n await mkdir(OUT_DIR, { recursive: true });\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_65","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"git -C D:\\\\ClawX show 42aaf5522499fbb940aa2dd1007967eb55adb0f3:docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/e01-reliability-aggregation.md; Write-Output \\\"=====RULE=====\\\"; git -C D:\\\\ClawX show 42aaf5522499fbb940aa2dd1007967eb55adb0f3:harness/specs/rules/reliability-aggregation-boundary.md\"","aggregated_output":"# E01 可靠性聚合与正反样本评测门\n\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：E01（TF-0274）。GPU/网络/付费调用：无。\n\n## 范围\n\n把可靠性口径接进既有的 Agent Dev benefit 报告：`pnpm agent-dev:evaluate`（`scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs`）现在除原有指标外，还输出 `reliability` 段。聚合逻辑在 `scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.mjs`（纯函数、无副作用，runner 与单元测试共用），数据来自预登记 fixture `shared/agent-dev/reliability-fixture.json`。不新建指标平台、不建持久 store、不改产品默认值/产品锁/approval 语义。\n\n## 口径（预登记）\n\n- `k=3`、`minCases>=20`、`flake<=0.01`；安全必测项 `0 skip / 0 flake`。\n- `pass^k` = “全部 k 次 trial 都通过”的**完整** case 比例；`pass@k`（至少一次通过）**单独**给出，二者不混用。\n- 任一 missing/timeout/crash/skip 使该 case 成为 `incomplete`：保留在 `incomplete` 列表、排除出 `pass^k`/`pass@k` 分母，绝不静默删除。\n- `flake` = 首次调度 trial 失败、后续固定重跑成功的完整 case 比例；首次失败保留，重试成功不洗掉原门失败。\n- 正/负锚点：`positive` 必须全通过、`negative` 必须全部拒绝；违反即 `gate=fail`。\n- 完整 case 数低于 `minCases` 时 `gate=insufficient-sample`，不以小样本冒充 PASS。\n\n## 本包结果\n\nfixture 故意小（4 个完整 case + 1 个 incomplete）：`passK=0.25`、`passAtK=0.75`、`perTrialSuccessRate=0.5`、`flakeRate=0.25`、`gate=insufficient-sample`。这是**确定性 oracle**，不是真实模型泛化证据，也不冒充 PASS。\n\n## 边界与不做项\n\n- 不搬真实 provider/真人证据；不宣称统计显著性。\n- 不把 `pass@k` 当 `pass^k`；不用重试抹掉首次失败。\n- 不改产品默认值/锁；不新增定时 automation；不新建第二份进度账本。=====RULE=====\r\n---\nid: reliability-aggregation-boundary\ntitle: 可靠性聚合边界（pass^k / flake / anchors）\n---\n\n# 可靠性聚合边界\n\n适用于本仓库的可靠性/稳定性聚合报告（Agent Dev benefit eval 及其后继）。\n\n- **pass^k 与 pass@k 不得混用**：`pass^k` 是“全部 k 次 trial 都通过”的完整 case 比例；`pass@k`（至少一次通过）必须单独报告。\n- **缺测显式保留**：任何 missing/timeout/crash/skip 的 trial 使该 case 成为 incomplete，必须保留并排除出 pass^k/pass@k 分母；不得静默删除或不计。\n- **flake 定义固定**：flake = 首次调度 trial 失败、后续固定重跑成功的完整 case 比例；首次失败必须保留，重试成功不得洗掉原门失败。\n- **安全必测**：标为 safety-required 的 case 必须 0 skip、0 flake；违反即 gate=fail。\n- **正负锚点**：positive 锚点必须全通过、negative 锚点必须全部拒绝；违反即 gate=fail。\n- **样本不足即 insufficient-sample**：完整 case 数低于预登记门（k=3、>=20）时 gate=insufficient-sample，不得以小样本冒充 PASS。\n- **确定性 oracle 必须标注**：fixture 驱动的结果必须显式标注为 deterministic、非真实 provider/真人证据，且不宣称泛化。\n- **不得改产品默认/锁/approval 语义**；不得为此新增定时 automation。","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
